{
  "id": "reporting-flow",
  "name": "Automated Reporting & Metrics Flow",
  "description": "Generates daily/weekly reports on automation delivery metrics and agent performance",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "trigger": {
    "type": "schedule",
    "displayName": "Daily Report Generation - 8 AM",
    "config": {
      "cronExpression": "0 8 * * *"
    }
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "define-report-period",
      "type": "data-transform",
      "displayName": "Define Report Period",
      "transform": {
        "reportType": "daily",
        "startDate": "{{dateAdd(now(), -1, 'days')}}",
        "endDate": "{{now()}}",
        "reportDate": "{{formatDate(now(), 'yyyy-MM-dd')}}"
      },
      "next": "collect-intake-metrics"
    },
    {
      "id": "collect-intake-metrics",
      "type": "orchestrator-queue",
      "displayName": "Query Intake Queue Metrics",
      "config": {
        "operation": "get-items-count",
        "queues": [
          "Q_FINANCE_INTAKE",
          "Q_HR_INTAKE",
          "Q_OPS_INTAKE",
          "Q_SHARED_INTAKE",
          "Q_PLANNING_REQUESTS"
        ],
        "startDate": "{{define-report-period.startDate}}",
        "endDate": "{{define-report-period.endDate}}"
      },
      "next": "collect-agent-metrics"
    },
    {
      "id": "collect-agent-metrics",
      "type": "storage",
      "displayName": "Collect Agent Execution Data",
      "config": {
        "storageType": "orchestrator-storage-bucket",
        "bucket": "monitoring-data",
        "operation": "list",
        "prefix": "agent-health",
        "startDate": "{{define-report-period.startDate}}",
        "endDate": "{{define-report-period.endDate}}"
      },
      "next": "collect-deployment-metrics"
    },
    {
      "id": "collect-deployment-metrics",
      "type": "storage",
      "displayName": "Collect Deployment Evidence",
      "config": {
        "storageType": "orchestrator-storage-bucket",
        "bucket": "evidence-packages",
        "operation": "list",
        "prefix": "deployment",
        "startDate": "{{define-report-period.startDate}}",
        "endDate": "{{define-report-period.endDate}}"
      },
      "next": "aggregate-metrics"
    },
    {
      "id": "aggregate-metrics",
      "type": "data-transform",
      "displayName": "Aggregate All Metrics",
      "input": {
        "intakeMetrics": "{{collect-intake-metrics.results}}",
        "agentMetrics": "{{collect-agent-metrics.files}}",
        "deploymentMetrics": "{{collect-deployment-metrics.files}}"
      },
      "transform": {
        "summary": {
          "totalIntakes": "{{intakeMetrics.total}}",
          "intakesByUnit": {
            "finance": "{{intakeMetrics.Q_FINANCE_INTAKE}}",
            "hr": "{{intakeMetrics.Q_HR_INTAKE}}",
            "ops": "{{intakeMetrics.Q_OPS_INTAKE}}",
            "shared": "{{intakeMetrics.Q_SHARED_INTAKE}}"
          },
          "planningRequests": "{{intakeMetrics.Q_PLANNING_REQUESTS}}",
          "agentExecutions": "{{agentMetrics.length}}",
          "avgAgentHealth": "{{agentMetrics.map(m => m.healthScore).reduce((a,b) => a+b, 0) / agentMetrics.length}}",
          "deploymentsAttempted": "{{deploymentMetrics.filter(d => d.status == 'attempted').length}}",
          "deploymentsSuccessful": "{{deploymentMetrics.filter(d => d.status == 'successful').length}}",
          "deploymentsBlocked": "{{deploymentMetrics.filter(d => d.status == 'blocked').length}}",
          "successRate": "{{(deploymentsSuccessful / deploymentsAttempted * 100).toFixed(2)}}%"
        },
        "trends": {
          "intakeGrowth": "{{calculateGrowth(intakeMetrics.total, previousPeriod.total)}}",
          "deploymentGrowth": "{{calculateGrowth(deploymentMetrics.length, previousPeriod.deployments)}}"
        }
      },
      "next": "generate-report"
    },
    {
      "id": "generate-report",
      "type": "data-transform",
      "displayName": "Generate Report Content",
      "input": {
        "metrics": "{{aggregate-metrics.summary}}",
        "trends": "{{aggregate-metrics.trends}}",
        "period": "{{define-report-period}}"
      },
      "transform": {
        "reportTitle": "UiPath Builder Agent - Daily Report",
        "reportDate": "{{period.reportDate}}",
        "markdown": "# UiPath Builder Agent - Daily Report\n\n**Date:** {{period.reportDate}}\n\n## Executive Summary\n\n- **Total Intake Requests:** {{metrics.totalIntakes}}\n- **Planning Requests:** {{metrics.planningRequests}}\n- **Agent Executions:** {{metrics.agentExecutions}}\n- **Deployments Success Rate:** {{metrics.successRate}}\n\n## Intake Breakdown by Business Unit\n\n| Business Unit | Count |\n|---------------|-------|\n| Finance | {{metrics.intakesByUnit.finance}} |\n| HR | {{metrics.intakesByUnit.hr}} |\n| Operations | {{metrics.intakesByUnit.ops}} |\n| Shared | {{metrics.intakesByUnit.shared}} |\n\n## Agent Health\n\n- **Average Health Score:** {{metrics.avgAgentHealth}}/100\n- **Total Executions:** {{metrics.agentExecutions}}\n\n## Deployment Metrics\n\n- **Attempted:** {{metrics.deploymentsAttempted}}\n- **Successful:** {{metrics.deploymentsSuccessful}}\n- **Blocked:** {{metrics.deploymentsBlocked}}\n- **Success Rate:** {{metrics.successRate}}\n\n## Trends\n\n- **Intake Growth:** {{trends.intakeGrowth}}%\n- **Deployment Growth:** {{trends.deploymentGrowth}}%\n\n---\n\n*Generated by UiPath Builder Agent Reporting Flow*"
        }
      },
      "next": "store-report"
    },
    {
      "id": "store-report",
      "type": "storage",
      "displayName": "Store Report to Storage Bucket",
      "config": {
        "storageType": "orchestrator-storage-bucket",
        "bucket": "monitoring-data",
        "operation": "write",
        "files": [
          {
            "name": "reports/daily-report-{{define-report-period.reportDate}}.md",
            "content": "{{generate-report.markdown}}"
          },
          {
            "name": "reports/daily-report-{{define-report-period.reportDate}}.json",
            "content": "{{aggregate-metrics}}"
          }
        ]
      },
      "next": "distribute-report"
    },
    {
      "id": "distribute-report",
      "type": "integration-service",
      "displayName": "Distribute Report via Email",
      "config": {
        "connector": "outlook",
        "action": "send-email",
        "parameters": {
          "to": ["leadership@company.com", "operations@company.com"],
          "cc": ["automation-team@company.com"],
          "subject": "📊 Builder Agent Daily Report - {{define-report-period.reportDate}}",
          "body": "{{generate-report.markdown}}",
          "attachments": [
            {
              "name": "report-data.json",
              "content": "{{aggregate-metrics}}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "next": "check-alerts"
    },
    {
      "id": "check-alerts",
      "type": "decision",
      "displayName": "Check for Alert Conditions",
      "input": {
        "condition": "{{aggregate-metrics.summary.successRate < 80 || aggregate-metrics.summary.deploymentsBlocked > 5}}"
      },
      "branches": [
        {
          "condition": "true",
          "next": "send-alert"
        },
        {
          "default": true,
          "next": "complete"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "send-alert",
      "type": "integration-service",
      "displayName": "Send Alert for Poor Performance",
      "config": {
        "connector": "outlook",
        "action": "send-email",
        "parameters": {
          "to": ["ops-lead@company.com"],
          "subject": "⚠️ Builder Agent Performance Alert - {{define-report-period.reportDate}}",
          "body": "Performance metrics are below threshold:\n\nSuccess Rate: {{aggregate-metrics.summary.successRate}} (threshold: 80%)\nBlocked Deployments: {{aggregate-metrics.summary.deploymentsBlocked}} (threshold: 5)\n\nImmediate review recommended.",
          "importance": "high"
        }
      },
      "next": "complete"
    },
    {
      "id": "complete",
      "type": "output",
      "displayName": "Report Generation Complete",
      "outputs": {
        "status": "success",
        "reportDate": "{{define-report-period.reportDate}}",
        "totalIntakes": "{{aggregate-metrics.summary.totalIntakes}}",
        "successRate": "{{aggregate-metrics.summary.successRate}}",
        "alertSent": "{{check-alerts.selectedBranch == 'true'}}"
      }
    }
  ],
  "metadata": {
    "category": "AgentHack Demo",
    "tags": ["reporting", "metrics", "analytics", "dashboard"],
    "author": "Builder Agent Team",
    "created": "2026-05-17"
  }
}
